// Memory history (design memory-history): "What did we talk about yesterday?" The message already carries
// yesterday's moments as recall (the bubble shows only the person's words); the agent may also run
// `buddy memory recall yesterday` (MemoryOp::Recall, a read) before it answers from them. Replay with
// BUDDY_EVENTS: the bear thinks, works the read, speaks and settles as in any turn.
